{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9ea7be7a-c215-8a4d-8553-0c9d7e00718a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:18:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dario Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:13:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello Kevin. I am calling about the water. The water, it come down the hill from the next street and go straight into my yard. Straight in. I am at 66 Bridge Street, down the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 66 Bridge Street. So this is from the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Yesterday the whole yard is like a pond. The drain at the corner, it is not taking nothing. The water just run past it and come to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So the street drain up the hill isn't keeping up and it's running down into your yard. Let me write that down. Is it in the house at all or just the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:15:04-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the yard for now, the side and the back. But it is up to the steps. Is not this bad last winter, you know? Last winter we have snow, we have rain, and nothing like this. Now every storm, same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a lot of water. Okay, side and back yard, nearly to the steps, worse than last year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:15:35-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So I want to know, when they last come by? To clean the drain, the crew. Because I never see nobody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. I don't have the cleaning dates in front of me from this screen. I can put in a request for a crew to look at that drain and the street above you, and note that you want to know the last time it was serviced. Somebody from the drainage side can call you back with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:16:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. That is fine. Yes, please. You can call me at 401-555-0174."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one seven four. And it's Mr. Monteiro, right? M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:16:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Dario. Monteiro, like you say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Dario. Crews are pretty stacked after a storm like this, so it may not be today, but it's in the system with your address and the callback."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:16:49-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm, I understand. They are busy. Is just, I come home from work and is already dark, you know? Five o'clock, finish. I cannot even see the water, I step in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:05-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's getting better but it still goes dark early. Not fun stepping into a puddle you can't see. If you can, grab a couple photos in daylight when it's running, and mention it when they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I take pictures this morning already. The water, it still is there little bit. I have the pictures on my phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. That helps. So to recap: 66 Bridge Street, runoff coming down from the next street into your yard, the corner drain not taking it, worse than last winter, and you want the last service date. Anything I missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:17:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Just please, somebody come look. Before the next storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it that way. You'll get a call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, Kevin. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:18:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Dario. Take care."
    }
  ],
